{"full":"hf:PRIMOmics/primo-eval","spaceId":"PRIMOmics/primo-eval","name":"PRIMO Benchmark","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":4,"created":"2026-07-07T16:00:54.000Z","updated":"2026-10-10T14:04:56.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://primomics-primo-eval.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/PRIMOmics/primo-eval","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:31.848Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:31.848Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:31.848Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🧬","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A blind benchmark for omics foundation models.","PRIMO grades how well a model turns a patient's omics data into a useful patient embedding. You select one modality, embed its datasets, and upload one file; a fixed probe scores each hidden task, and the results roll up into a blind, per-category leaderboard. The datasets are opaque (d002, d003…) and you never see the disease, tissue, or target, which leaves you grading the embedding itself with no room for per-task tuning.","A left rail navigates six pages: Boards (a grid of every board), Board (one leaderboard at a time), Tasks, a Submit form (sign in with Hugging Face), Contribute, and Method. Every board has its own URL, ?board=oncology-bulk-rna, and every page too, as ?tab=contribute, so the rail links and the open cards are shareable deep links."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/PRIMOmics/primo-eval/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7126149cc9c45e37e0463006a7ee5d345a80f51fc49f4d2009c1c4824453d57a","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:41:12.319Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T16:56:31.939Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A blind benchmark for omics foundation models.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingf